@startuml
!include _libcpg-theme.iuml
title Boolean condition feasibility — heap-resident pushdown machine

skinparam backgroundColor #FCFCFC
skinparam state {
  BorderColor #495057
  BackgroundColor #DBE4FF
  StartColor #2B8A3E
  EndColor #C92A2A
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFF3BF
  BorderColor #495057
}

[*] --> Enter : root · required truth · entry intervals
state Enter #DBE4FF
state "Expand logical node" as Expand #C3FAE8
state "Evaluate comparison region" as Compare #E5DBFF
state "Apply one interval meet" as Meet #D3F9D8
state "Emit live alternative" as Live #B2F2BB
state "Emit contradiction evidence" as Empty #FFE3E3
state "Emit typed issue" as Issue #FCC2D7
state "Advance explicit continuation" as Continue #FFE8CC

Enter --> Expand : ! · && · ||
Enter --> Compare : < · <= · > · >= · == · !=
Enter --> Live : Boolean literal matches request
Enter --> Empty : Boolean literal contradicts request
Enter --> Issue : missing · cycle · unsupported · cap

Expand --> Enter : push operand frame(s)
Compare --> Meet : each disjoint integer region
Compare --> Empty : supported predicate has no region
Meet --> Live : non-empty intersection
Meet --> Empty : empty intersection
Live --> Continue
Empty --> Continue
Issue --> [*]
Continue --> Enter : pending frame
Continue --> [*] : frame stack empty

note right of Expand
  true(A && B): A=true, then B=true
  false(A && B): A=false OR A=true then B=false
  false(A || B): A=false, then B=false
  true(A || B): A=true OR A=false then B=true
end note

note right of Compare
  Equality yields one singleton region.
  Disequality yields two disjoint regions.
  Integer extrema may yield zero regions.
end note

note bottom of Continue
  Frames, active-node marks, alternatives, and predicate witnesses
  live on the heap. Source nesting never becomes native call depth.
end note
@enduml
